#: 55c4cf77b6b94c80b5504172a890d9b3 of
#: pybroker.interval.lookahead_train_dates:4
msgid ""
"The walkforward split holds out ``lookahead`` bars of the *base* "
"timeframe, but a model bound to an interval is fitted on compressed bars,"
" so the hold-out must be re-measured in compressed-bar units: every kept "
"train bar satisfies ``compressed_index <= first_test_compressed_index - "
"lookahead``."
msgstr ""

